        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false
        },
        "content": "### 🚀 Microservice Observability Pipeline (Metrics, Meta-Monitoring & Telemetry)\n**HTTP Chain:** Client ➔ Service A (`:8000`) ➔ Service B (`:8001`) ➔ Service C (`:8002`) ➔ Postgres DB\n**Telemetry Flow:** Stdout ➔ Fluent Bit Shipper ➔ Kafka (`app-logs`) ➔ Fluent Bit Consumer ➔ Loki & Jaeger\n**Meta-Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes Services (RED), Kafka Exporter (Consumer Lag), Fluent Bit, Loki, & Jaeger. Alertmanager pages Slack.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "title": "Pipeline Overview & Architecture",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "RED: Request Rate (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
